    elseif($mode===2){$count=4+($i%5);$start=18+2*$i;$vals=[];for($j=0;$j<$count;$j++)$vals[]=$start+($j*2)+(($j%2)*2);$sum=array_sum($vals);if($sum%$count!==0){$vals[$count-1]+=$count-($sum%$count);$sum=array_sum($vals);}$ans=$sum/$count;$stem="The {$story} processed these numbers of complete files over {$count} days: ".implode(', ',$vals).". What was the mean per day?";$why='Add the daily counts and divide by the number of days: '.$sum.' ÷ '.$count.' = '.$ans.'.';$concept='cse-averages';$family='mean-from-series';$mis='mean-denominator-error';$calc=['operation'=>'mean','values'=>$vals,'expected'=>$ans];$wrong=[$sum,$sum/($count-1),$ans+2];}
