 ['cse-sequence-inference','A tracking sequence is 2, 6, 15, 31, 56; its successive increases are 2², 3², 4², and 5². What follows?','92',['86','91','96'],'The next increase is 6² = 36; 56 + 36 = 92.','square-increment-sequence','repeat-last-increase'],
 ['cse-sequence-inference','A reporting sequence is 81, 27, 9, 3. What follows?','1',['0','−3','1/3'],'Each term is divided by 3.','geometric-decrease','subtract-three'],
