 ['cse-parallel-structure','Which list keeps all three required actions in the same grammatical form?','Check the source, compare the copy, and record the difference.',['Check the source, comparing the copy, and the difference is recorded.','Checking the source, compare the copy, and recording the difference.','Check the source, the copy comparison, and record the difference.'],'The three coordinated actions use base-form verbs.','parallel-procedure-list','mixed-forms',3],
