 ['cse-grammar-application','Choose the sentence with consistent past-tense verbs.','The clerk checked the date, signed the log, and filed the copy.',['The clerk checked the date, signs the log, and filed the copy.','The clerk checks the date, signed the log, and files the copy.','The clerk checking the date, signed the log, and filing the copy.'],'The coordinated verbs all report completed actions in the past tense.','tense-consistency','tense-shift',2],
