 ['cse-error-recognition','Which sentence correctly uses fewer with a countable noun?','Fewer applications were returned this week.',['Less applications were returned this week.','Fewer time was needed this week.','Fewest paperwork was returned this week.'],'Applications are countable items, so fewer is appropriate.','countable-modifier','less-fewer',2],
